sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff<br/>POS retry
  participant Order as Order
  participant ODB as PostgreSQL<br/>Order DB
  participant Catalog as Catalog
  participant CDB as PostgreSQL<br/>Catalog DB

  Staff->>Order: Confirm order
  Order->>Catalog: Deduct stock<br/>same key + immutable payload
  Catalog->>CDB: Commit RESERVED version 1
  Catalog--xOrder: APPLIED response lost
  Order->>ODB: Roll back transaction<br/>order remains PENDING

  Staff->>Order: Retry confirm command
  Order->>Catalog: Deduct stock again<br/>same key + payload hash
  Catalog->>CDB: Lock active reservation
  CDB-->>Catalog: Stored result and version 1
  Catalog-->>Order: REPLAYED + reservationVersion
  Order->>ODB: Commit PROCESSING<br/>+ version + outbox
  Order-->>Staff: Confirmation success

  Note over Catalog,CDB: Replay does not change stock rows.<br/>The same key and payload turn an ambiguous response into a safe retry.
